{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An Idle RPG with Fully Automated Battles.</strong><br>Lead your heroes and armies to conquer challenging stages and powerful bosses. Through equipment, skills, and hero class changes, you can forge your own ultimate playstyle!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fully Automated Combat</strong><br>Simply decide on stat distribution, skill sets, and army compositions, then let the battles play out automatically\u2014making your growth experience effortless and fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deep Progression System</strong><br>Hero class changes, skill combos, and equipment upgrades\u2014all are yours to freely plan and optimize.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Formidable Boss Fights</strong><br>Every 100 stages brings an encounter with a super-strong boss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Limitless Growth</strong><br>Keep powering up to push your stats to the absolute limits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rebirth &amp; Sublimation</strong><br>Choose to reset stages for extra rewards, or use the Sublimation Potion for a more flexible reset experience.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3365320?t=1740709824","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3365320?t=1740709824","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365320/ac4d153cc7e3c0b8df776109bbe489877f5f5e5f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740709824","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365320/ac4d153cc7e3c0b8df776109bbe489877f5f5e5f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740709824","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed